sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Seller
    participant M as Exit market
    participant B as Buyer
    S->>M: Escrow receipts, set the auction curve
    Note over M,B: The discount rises in steps, never falls
    B->>M: Buy at the current discount
    M->>S: Payment, at once
    S->>M: Take back the unsold rest, any time
    opt Sell now instead
        S->>M: Sell into chosen escrowed bids
        M->>S: Each bid pays from its escrow
    end
